  "title": "Netflow: convert to ws_log system",
  "description": "Use the ws_log system instead of custom debug routines. If Wireshark\nisn't compiled for the Debug target, the compiler will optimize away all\nthese calls.\n\nReplace `ipfix_debug()` (which was itself `#define`d to be\n`ws_warning()`) with `ws_debug()`. Remove function names from logged\nstrings since those are already handled by the logging system.\n\nPing #19519",
